<title>UK: Vickers year pre-tax profit up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Vickers year pre-tax profit up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.7		   vs 15.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.5		    vs 4.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.2		    vs 6.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     83.3		   vs 75.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,197.6		vs 1,143.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 82 and 85 million stg and a dividend of 7-7.5p.</p>
<p>Full company name - Vickers Group Plc</p>
</text>
